# What `just dprint-update` may change (dev/unlisted.sh's patterns, the last that matches deciding).
# dev/dprint_plugins.py refuses an update that changes anything else, and so does
# dprint-plugins.yml's `propose` (dev/propose.sh), from its own checkout's copy.
# the root's Markdown and TOML, which its dprint formats -- not a template root's, nor
# shared/template/'s: their Liquid is formatted in a generated project
*.md
*.toml
!typst/*
!python/*
!rust/*
!shared/template/*
# each dprint.json, its plugins moved
dprint.json
*/dprint.json
# shared/root/'s Markdown and TOML, formatted at the root, and copied into the templates by
# `just sync`
*/cliff.toml
*/cog.toml
*/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/documentation.md
